\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Lottie's personal story and face are central to all positioning. The business carries meaningful founder-dependency risk at this size. As Up World grows, the transition from "Lottie's community" to "Up World the brand" is a real and necessary evolution. A coach might explore: *how is Lottie thinking about her role evolving, and what does she want the business to be able to do without her?*\cb1 \
