\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Three intake windows per year means revenue, marketing effort, and community onboarding are concentrated. This creates pressure spikes. A coach might explore: *how does the team experience and manage these peaks, and is the current rhythm sustainable?*\cb1 \
