\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 The 28 May Up Talk signals awareness of this moment. Up World's specific audience \'97 resource-constrained marketers at start-ups \'97 is exactly the group under most pressure to upskill on AI quickly. "AI marketing for lean teams" is a defensible content and course niche that no large player owns yet in the UK.\cb1 \
